      "content": "thanks. i checked the filter and it seems fine but the error wont go away. how do i actually get to that leak sensor area to dry it out? do i have to take the whole thing out from under the counter or is there a way to just dry the base? i'm worried there is water just sitting in the bottom pan where i can't see it.",
